@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@token = replace-with-a-valid-access-token
@id = 1

### List active authorization resources
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/recursos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get one resource
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/recursos/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Invalid id returns 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/recursos/not-an-id
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Missing token returns 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/recursos
